sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Harness
  participant FS as skills/
  participant M as Model

  H->>FS: session start: frontmatter of every SKILL.md
  FS-->>H: name and description of each skill
  H->>M: list of skills in the system context, about 100 tokens per skill
  Note over H,M: the router using-java-best-practices is in context in full:<br/>GigaCode through contextFileName or GIGACODE.md,<br/>Claude and Codex through SessionStart output
  M->>H: task about an entity: load spring-data-jpa
  H->>FS: SKILL.md body
  FS-->>H: skill text, up to 150 lines
  H->>M: skill body in context
  M->>H: read references/entities.md via the link in the skill
  H-->>M: reference file, up to 250 lines
